Package: erhai-audio
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: alsa-ucm-conf (>= 1.2.4), python3
Description: OnePlus Pad 2 Pro (erhai) audio topology and configuration
 Device-specific AudioReach topology built from pinned upstream sources.
 The current candidate provides the internal microphone capture graph and
 a UCM profile for the board's two analog microphones.
 .
 The internal speakers are a candidate that stays off: erhai-audio-speaker
 enable offers them until the next boot, at an amplifier level 20 dB below
 the stock profile, and disable withdraws them. The stock speaker protection
 and tuning have no counterpart here yet. USB headset support is still under
 development.
